{"id": "754f2d1bba106f03", "field": "text", "it": "Ti sei <arreso/arresa>. Ho vinto io.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g25-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "754f2d1bba106f03", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "7553545abe2251a2", "field": "text", "it": "Non posso lasciare il mio posto, {name}, ma c'è un compito da sbrigare. Posso fidarmi di te per portarlo a termine?", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g25-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "7553545abe2251a2", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "7554b2bae0ae97d9", "field": "text", "it": "Questo raggio di luna ti porterà a ⟦Thunder Bluff=Picco del Tuono⟧. Usalo quando vuoi lasciare la festa.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g25-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "7554b2bae0ae97d9", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
